</section>
<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3. </span>Details of Prompts</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The detailed contents of prompts used in AgentDR are shownd from Table <a href="#A1.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ A.3. Details of Prompts ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ AgentDR: Dynamic Recommendation with Implicit Item-Item Relations via LLM-based Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> to Table <a href="#A1.T13" title="Table 13 ‣ A.3. Details of Prompts ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ AgentDR: Dynamic Recommendation with Implicit Item-Item Relations via LLM-based Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a>.</p>
</div>
